        "code": {
          "text": "Right upper eyelid lump"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reported lump at the right upper eyelid margin for “a week or two… maybe longer”; onset uncertain. Described as pea-sized, firm but not rock hard, not very tender when pressed, and more annoying/heavy than painful; gets in the way when reading or watching television. Tel-consult only; no visual examination."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
